WEBVTT

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.700
Well, that was easy.

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:14.760
You dare attack a goddess?

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:17.910
You may kill me,

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:20.290
but my sisters...

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:23.500
will not fall!

00:00:32.810 --> 00:00:35.630
I suppose I should finish the job.

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:53.210
Kanon!

00:00:53.210 --> 00:00:54.630
Hey, Kanon!

00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:55.680
Why?

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:56.920
Kanon...

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:58.690
Kanon!

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:36.040
<b>Scramble Formation</b>

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:39.020
Haqua...

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:41.020
Do something!

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:42.470
I'm working on it.

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:45.810
Sister Apollo was inside this girl.

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:48.090
I was so close to seeing her.

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:50.120
Why?

00:02:51.510 --> 00:02:52.440
All right.

00:02:52.780 --> 00:02:53.560
Watch out!

00:02:58.240 --> 00:02:59.160
Ow.

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:00.640
What is this?

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:02.910
This is ancient demon magic...

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:03.660
Huh?

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:05.580
The power instilled in this sword

00:03:05.940 --> 00:03:10.410
is assassination magic used by 
the Weiss we sealed so long ago.

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:13.420
Ancient demon magic is forbidden.

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:16.090
Offenders are thrown in prison or worse!

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:20.470
Does that mean some Weiss have returned?

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:22.470
What's wrong?

00:03:23.150 --> 00:03:25.620
This is the mark of Vintage.

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:26.970
Vintage?

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:31.060
A cult of modern demons who seek 
to revive the ancient demons.

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:34.480
They may know how to use ancient demon magic.

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:39.240
You can find assassination magic in 
today's Hell, but this is far stronger.

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:43.240
An ordinary human would instantly 
lose all their energy and die.

00:03:44.020 --> 00:03:46.640
The power of the goddess is sustaining her.

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:50.410
However, it won't last. Eventually...

00:03:52.170 --> 00:03:54.250
Don't just stop there.

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:57.500
Tell us how many days before she dies.

00:03:58.740 --> 00:04:01.520
From here on, we focus on 
exchanging information.

00:04:01.520 --> 00:04:02.360
Eh?

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:05.010
The information I have will 
determine my choices.

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:06.740
Choices?

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:07.960
How can you say that?!

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:13.350
Exalted Brother, you have to help her! 
Kanon is in love with you!

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:16.430
If the conditions are met.

00:04:16.430 --> 00:04:18.440
First, I'll need information.

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:19.820
Conditions?

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:21.390
A life is on the line!

00:04:21.390 --> 00:04:23.200
This isn't a game!

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:25.910
Indeed, this isn't a game.

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:26.910
That's why...

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:30.660
I have to save her!

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:33.870
Time is of the essence.

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:35.540
In order to do what's best,

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:37.250
I need information.

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:38.960
Haqua...

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:39.710
Huh?

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.630
How many days does Kanon have to live?

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:44.340
M-Maybe a week?

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:46.260
Once the miasma spreads through her body,

00:04:46.780 --> 00:04:48.250
she'll die.

00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:49.960
One week.

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:50.760
Got it.

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:53.110
The goddesses are the

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:56.110
strongest weapons we have 
against the ancient demons.

00:04:56.870 --> 00:04:59.860
Didn't you say it was the goddesses 
who sealed the Weiss once before?

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:04.000
However, I do not currently have 
sufficient power to extract this.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:06.100
What if you had another goddess to help you?

00:05:07.190 --> 00:05:11.650
If my other sisters were here, 
we could do anything.

00:05:11.650 --> 00:05:12.410
Understood.

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:15.000
I'll find the goddesses before the week ends.

00:05:15.900 --> 00:05:17.150
We need to hurry.

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:22.280
This Vintage cult is probably 
targeting the others as we speak.

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:23.320
It should be fine.

00:05:23.820 --> 00:05:26.840
My sister Apollo dispatched a warning.

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:31.350
It's written in the ancient language of Heaven.

00:05:31.880 --> 00:05:33.970
"We have been betrayed by Hell.

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:35.850
Trust no one."

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:38.770
My sisters will be on their guard...

00:05:39.320 --> 00:05:42.110
Which means they'll be even 
further from our reach.

00:05:42.560 --> 00:05:43.940
That's for the best.

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:45.620
One less thing to worry about.

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:50.100
You must have a plan in mind.

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:52.870
For the time being, I shall go into hiding.

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:55.460
Don't contact me unless absolutely necessary.

00:05:55.460 --> 00:05:56.580
I have a question.

00:05:57.090 --> 00:05:59.330
How many sisters do you have?

00:05:59.700 --> 00:06:00.790
There are six of us.

00:06:01.510 --> 00:06:02.630
Vulcanus.

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:03.510
Apollo.

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:04.440
Diana.

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:05.350
Minerva.

00:06:05.350 --> 00:06:06.210
Mars.

00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:07.250
Mercurius.

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:10.470
We six are known as the Jupiter Sisters.

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:12.970
Six... Got it.

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:15.010
I am counting on you.

00:06:17.300 --> 00:06:19.680
Tenri, go home.

00:06:19.680 --> 00:06:21.270
Don't let Diana out.

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:22.320
Okay.

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:29.070
One week to find four goddesses...

00:06:29.470 --> 00:06:30.110
Well?

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:32.290
Where do we start?

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:33.590
Idol training.

00:06:33.590 --> 00:06:34.370
Huh?

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:36.250
<b>Narusawa TV</b>

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:37.830
She's late!

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:40.500
S-Sorry for being late!

00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:43.000
U-Um...

00:06:43.230 --> 00:06:46.510
I'm Kanon...

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:49.330
Stop fooling around!

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:50.870
My Exalted Brother told me to do this!

00:06:50.870 --> 00:06:53.350
Do you know how many times I called?

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:54.690
Everyone's waiting for you!

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:57.330
Kanon, hurry up.

00:06:57.330 --> 00:06:59.100
Oh, okay!

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:02.070
She used her raiment to change her hair.

00:07:02.070 --> 00:07:03.590
The rest is an illusion spell.

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:06.230
<b>What Manager Okada Sees</b>

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:07.960
To other humans, she looks like Kanon.

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:11.590
But to us, she just looks like Elsie in disguise.

00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:13.810
Yep, it seems to be working.

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:16.510
That takes care of Kanon's absence.

00:07:16.510 --> 00:07:17.450
Which only leaves...

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:21.350
Hello, this is the Katsuragi residence.

00:07:21.880 --> 00:07:23.960
Oh, you work with my husband?

00:07:24.490 --> 00:07:26.660
Your husband is at death's door.

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:27.460
Huh?!

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:31.140
Darling!

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:31.680
<b>I'm off to 
South America! 

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:34.900
That gets Mom out of the house for a while.

00:07:34.900 --> 00:07:37.280
I'll be able to focus on the problem at hand.

00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:39.630
You're pretty heavy-handed...

00:07:39.630 --> 00:07:42.690
Haqua, come to my house 
tomorrow morning.

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:43.400
Huh?

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:45.440
You and I will search for the goddesses.

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:49.110
For the next week, you will be my Buddy.

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:50.320
Huh?

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:52.320
<b>The Next Morning</b>

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:56.330
<b>Goddess Search, Day 1</b>

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:02.330
So, how are we supposed to 
search for the goddesses?

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:04.040
There's no need.

00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:07.800
The goddesses are inside 
the targets I conquered.

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:08.650
Huh?

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:09.590
How do you know that?

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:13.350
Diana is in Tenri, and Apollo is in Kanon.

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:16.220
They were both targets.

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:17.890
Also, Diana mentioned

00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:23.310
that a girl who is host to a goddess 
will remember the conquest.

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:25.200
That was true with Kanon.

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:27.520
Th-That's it?

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:28.890
Just watch.

00:08:28.890 --> 00:08:32.330
Kanon left us a present 
that should do the trick.

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:33.070
A present?

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:34.190
Over there.

00:08:34.190 --> 00:08:36.220
That's Kanon's boyfriend?

00:08:36.220 --> 00:08:37.620
No way!

00:08:36.220 --> 00:08:37.620
Isn't that the dweeb?

00:08:38.070 --> 00:08:39.870
Kanon confessed her love to him.

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:43.000
Everyone's looking at us.

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:44.230
Perfect...

00:08:44.230 --> 00:08:46.450
The more the rumors spread,

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:48.760
the easier it will be to flush 
out potential goddess hosts.

00:08:48.760 --> 00:08:49.630
What do you mean?

00:08:50.220 --> 00:08:51.270
It's simple.

00:08:51.270 --> 00:08:54.780
If one of my targets hosts a goddess 
and remembers the conquest,

00:08:54.780 --> 00:08:57.090
she'll still be in love with me.

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:59.350
How can you take this so calmly?

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:04.520
After hearing about Kanon's confession, 
she won't be very happy.

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:05.670
In other words...

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:08.480
If any of my targets are mad at me, 
they're a potential host.

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:12.180
Hot! Hot!

00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:14.920
Oops... Sorry.

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:16.190
Chihiro?

00:09:16.190 --> 00:09:17.820
My hand slipped.

00:09:18.460 --> 00:09:20.380
Oh? Ellie!

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:22.540
You changed your hair.

00:09:22.800 --> 00:09:25.020
Oh! Um, well...

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:24.410
<b>This Is How She Looks</b>

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:29.290
Hey, how does Elsie usually act at school?

00:09:29.620 --> 00:09:31.240
Exactly as you are now.

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:32.490
Just flounder around.

00:09:33.520 --> 00:09:34.300
Ayumi.

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:36.300
Morning, Katsuragi!

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:37.180
Huh?

00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:39.930
I can't go in with you standing there...

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:41.640
So move it!

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:52.690
<i>Chihiro and Ayumi are both angry.</i>

00:09:56.760 --> 00:10:00.780
<b>Maijima Academy Middle School</b>

00:09:57.620 --> 00:09:58.490
Hello.

00:09:59.100 --> 00:10:00.780
Long time no see, Minami.

00:10:02.650 --> 00:10:05.540
Um, have we met before?

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:11.550
So you're working here now.

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:13.550
That's great.

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:16.050
Who are you?

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:20.930
Hmm?

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:22.180
What's that?

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:24.140
A list of the girls I've conquered.

00:10:24.730 --> 00:10:26.530
It's grown quite a bit.

00:10:26.530 --> 00:10:30.000
After my inspection today, 
I can narrow this list down to five.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:31.010
How?

00:10:31.010 --> 00:10:34.710
My theory is that the girls 
most closely related to me

00:10:34.710 --> 00:10:35.860
are hosting goddesses.

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:36.400
Huh?

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.280
<b>Tenri                           Tsukiyo                                       Rieko</b>

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.280
<b>Keima          Ayumi      Shiori       Kusunoki                       Sumire</b>

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.280
<b>Chihiro          Yui          Akari      Nagase        Nanaka</b>

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.280
<b>Kanon              Mio                 Minami               Hinoki</b>

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:37.820
These names are listed

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:40.500
in the order of how close each one is to me.

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:55.920
<b>Tenri                           Tsukiyo                                       Rieko</b>

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:55.920
<b>Keima          Ayumi      Shiori       Kusunoki                       Sumire</b>

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:55.920
<b>Chihiro          Yui          Akari      Nagase        Nanaka</b>

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:55.920
<b>Kanon              Mio                 Minami               Hinoki</b>

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:42.220
Goddesses are inside

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:45.030
Tenri, my childhood friend and neighbor,

00:10:45.030 --> 00:10:47.380
and Kanon, my classmate.

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:51.230
Two more classmates, Ayumi and Chihiro,

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:55.670
were clearly mad at me today, so they're suspect.

00:10:56.090 --> 00:11:18.820
<b>Tenri                           Tsukiyo                                       Rieko</b>

00:10:56.090 --> 00:11:18.820
<b>Keima          Ayumi      Shiori       Kusunoki                       Sumire</b>

00:10:56.090 --> 00:11:18.820
<b>Chihiro          Yui          Akari      Nagase        Nanaka</b>

00:10:56.090 --> 00:11:18.820
<b>Kanon              Mio                 Minami               Hinoki</b>

00:10:56.420 --> 00:11:00.900
I confirmed that the third-year Kusunoki's memory

00:11:00.900 --> 00:11:04.100
was wiped during my conquest of Hinoki.

00:11:04.990 --> 00:11:07.520
Today proved the younger Minami

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:09.510
remembers nothing, either.

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:12.670
In other words, it's unlikely

00:11:12.670 --> 00:11:15.760
that girls who aren't in my grade host goddesses.

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:18.940
Akari Kurakawa also fits in that category.

00:11:19.690 --> 00:11:22.390
The rest on the right are also unlikely hosts,

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:23.760
given their low encounter rates.

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:28.080
<b>Tenri                           Tsukiyo                                       Rieko</b>

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:28.080
<b>Keima          Ayumi      Shiori       Kusunoki                       Sumire</b>

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:28.080
<b>Chihiro          Yui          Akari      Nagase        Nanaka</b>

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:28.080
<b>Kanon              Mio                 Minami               Hinoki</b>

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:26.500
So I can disregard those to the right of the line

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:27.790
for this mission.

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:33.460
<b>Tenri                           Tsukiyo                                       Rieko</b>

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:33.460
<b>Keima          Ayumi      Shiori       Kusunoki                       Sumire</b>

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:33.460
<b>Chihiro          Yui          Akari      Nagase        Nanaka</b>

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:33.460
<b>Kanon              Mio                 Minami               Hinoki</b>

00:11:28.530 --> 00:11:31.100
I just confirmed that Mio doesn't remember.

00:11:31.100 --> 00:11:32.130
Which means...

00:11:32.130 --> 00:11:33.210
Including the suspicious ones...

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:34.750
<b>Ayumi</b>

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:36.190
Ayumi, Chihiro, Tsukiyo,

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:35.420
<b>Ayumi                                                               Chihiro</b>

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:36.300
<b>Ayumi       Tsukiyo                                             Chihiro</b>

00:11:36.190 --> 00:11:37.730
Shiori, Yui.

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:36.960
<b>Ayumi       Tsukiyo                              Shiori       Chihiro</b>

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:41.840
<b>Ayumi       Tsukiyo           Yui              Shiori       Chihiro</b>

00:11:38.310 --> 00:11:42.010
Those five hold the four remaining goddesses.

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:44.260
All four remaining goddesses?

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:47.800
But that's based on their relationships to you.

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:50.020
I may have had this all backwards.

00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:53.130
The goddesses need love 
to restore their power.

00:11:53.130 --> 00:11:57.020
We've determined that two 
are within my conquests.

00:11:57.550 --> 00:12:01.740
Perhaps I was chosen to be a Buddy

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:04.280
in order to help revive the goddesses.

00:12:05.830 --> 00:12:09.670
My purpose is to provide the love 
that's required to awaken them.

00:12:09.690 --> 00:12:11.790
Th-That's impossible...

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:14.290
Otherwise, the one arranging this scenario

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:16.040
sorely lacks in competence.

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:18.890
I can't keep up with all your assumptions!

00:12:18.890 --> 00:12:21.440
I only have a week to complete my conquests.

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:24.240
I need only to rely on what's most probable.

00:12:24.240 --> 00:12:25.110
Time to go home.

00:12:25.110 --> 00:12:26.930
Oh... See you tomorrow.

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:27.550
Haqua...

00:12:28.630 --> 00:12:30.270
Starting today, you should stay with me.

00:12:31.490 --> 00:12:33.110
H-Hold on...

00:12:33.110 --> 00:12:35.430
No one else is there right now!

00:12:35.430 --> 00:12:37.520
I can't be there alone with you!

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:40.580
We won't be alone.

00:12:41.420 --> 00:12:42.770
Kanon's there.

00:12:43.870 --> 00:12:46.030
Her condition hasn't changed.

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:48.500
For now, she should be okay.

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:49.480
I see.

00:13:05.110 --> 00:13:08.680
<i>I've never seen Katsuragi so serious before.</i>

00:13:10.230 --> 00:13:13.710
<i>How am I supposed to bring out the 
goddesses within this time limit?</i>

00:13:14.260 --> 00:13:17.560
<i>And once the goddesses are revealed, 
Vintage will go after them.</i>

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:20.640
<i>I can't let anyone else end up like Kanon.</i>

00:13:21.470 --> 00:13:24.210
<i>What can I do?</i>

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:26.470
<i>What is there I can do?</i>

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:30.860
<i>I have to be there for Katsuragi.</i>

00:13:31.680 --> 00:13:32.980
Is that really...

00:13:32.980 --> 00:13:34.700
But that's...

00:13:36.380 --> 00:13:38.380
Oh? You're taking a bath?

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:40.910
Perfect timing.

00:13:40.910 --> 00:13:42.010
I've made my decision.

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:45.110
Haqua, I will cease to be a god.

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:47.760
I will...

00:13:49.190 --> 00:13:50.890
become the gaming world's devil!

00:13:56.370 --> 00:13:59.060
<b>Goddess Search, Day 2</b>

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:00.530
Ayumi...

00:14:01.180 --> 00:14:02.820
Wh-What is it?

00:14:03.200 --> 00:14:05.660
No matter what anyone else says to me,

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:07.950
I don't want you to get the wrong idea!

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:09.270
Huh?

00:14:09.270 --> 00:14:10.720
A-Ayumi...

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:12.700
You're the one I...

00:14:17.680 --> 00:14:19.630
A-Are you insane?

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:21.320
Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!

00:14:22.440 --> 00:14:23.860
Chihiro went to the store

00:14:23.860 --> 00:14:26.360
to get some of their new pork buns, 
so she'll be back soon.

00:14:26.360 --> 00:14:27.240
Time to move.

00:14:32.160 --> 00:14:34.500
Why are you confessing your love to everyone?

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:36.550
If we only revive the goddesses,

00:14:36.550 --> 00:14:38.550
Vintage will come after them.

00:14:38.550 --> 00:14:41.730
Goddesses need love to fuel their power.

00:14:42.260 --> 00:14:45.480
The girls are feeling down, 
having heard the Kanon rumors.

00:14:45.970 --> 00:14:49.690
But when they overcome mishaps 
and misunderstandings like these,

00:14:49.690 --> 00:14:51.780
their love parameters will skyrocket.

00:14:52.730 --> 00:14:56.000
I need the girls to fall in love with me again.

00:14:56.490 --> 00:15:01.000
I have to reach their endings again to 
give the goddesses back their powers.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:04.070
But there are five potential hosts.

00:15:04.070 --> 00:15:06.190
I'll have to conquer them at the same time.

00:15:06.190 --> 00:15:07.270
At the same time?

00:15:07.270 --> 00:15:08.420
You're disgusting!

00:15:16.090 --> 00:15:17.270
Chihiro...

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:18.850
Uh, I'm sorry.

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:19.850
Huh?

00:15:20.300 --> 00:15:22.860
You're probably mad about Kanon...

00:15:23.620 --> 00:15:24.890
No idea what you mean.

00:15:24.890 --> 00:15:26.110
It's not what you think!

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:27.100
Huh?!

00:15:27.100 --> 00:15:29.240
He's following this script to the letter.

00:15:29.710 --> 00:15:32.420
I don't want you to get the wrong idea.

00:15:33.270 --> 00:15:34.120
Chihiro...

00:15:35.380 --> 00:15:37.910
Y-You're the one I...

00:15:38.810 --> 00:15:40.830
<i>Wait for Chihiro to react.</i>

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:42.610
<i>If she says something, move to the next line.</i>

00:15:42.610 --> 00:15:44.670
<i>Otherwise, act embarrassed and leave.</i>

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:48.900
Wh-What's this?

00:15:48.900 --> 00:15:50.700
How can you say that with 
such a serious expression?

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:52.240
<i>If she treats it like a joke...</i>

00:15:55.910 --> 00:15:58.060
Get away from me, you cockroach.

00:16:01.070 --> 00:16:04.480
You could at least change your lines...

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:06.300
Her anger hasn't subsided,

00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:08.160
and I set up our next encounter.

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:09.600
Not bad.

00:16:10.430 --> 00:16:12.330
I'll need your help with the next one.

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:12.820
Eh?

00:16:13.260 --> 00:16:15.550
<i>Walk home with either Chihiro or Ayumi,</i>

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:17.030
<i>and make sure they don't meet.</i>

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:20.220
Ellie, wanna grab some cake before we go home?

00:16:20.220 --> 00:16:21.960
S-Sure!

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:25.330
<b>Astronomy Club</b>

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:29.000
<i>Nothing has refuted my theory, 
but nothing has proven it.</i>

00:16:29.580 --> 00:16:32.170
<i>It's easy to tell when Ayumi 
and Chihiro act differently.</i>

00:16:32.530 --> 00:16:34.130
<i>But it gets harder from here.</i>

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:38.430
Luna, the next full moon isn't for a while,

00:16:39.270 --> 00:16:41.780
so there's no point in looking at the sky...

00:16:42.910 --> 00:16:44.260
Tsukiyo...

00:16:46.260 --> 00:16:47.240
Sorry.

00:16:47.720 --> 00:16:49.690
Are you mad about Kanon?

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:52.650
Who are you?

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:57.270
<i>Does she not remember me?</i>

00:16:57.270 --> 00:17:00.220
<i>Or is this how she shows her anger?</i>

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:04.420
There's nothing between Kanon and me!

00:17:04.730 --> 00:17:08.110
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:10.170
Who is Kanon?

00:17:10.470 --> 00:17:14.100
<i>Is it safe to assume she doesn't remember me?</i>

00:17:17.770 --> 00:17:19.430
What was that all about?

00:17:19.870 --> 00:17:21.230
<i>She's coming this way!</i>

00:17:21.230 --> 00:17:22.080
Over here!

00:17:24.950 --> 00:17:26.770
How stupid...

00:17:27.330 --> 00:17:28.900
<i>I can't let them meet!</i>

00:17:29.330 --> 00:17:30.810
<i>If this becomes a love rectangle,</i>

00:17:30.810 --> 00:17:32.900
<i>it'll become harder to trigger the right flags.</i>

00:17:34.880 --> 00:17:37.260
What do you think you're doing, you animal?!

00:17:38.350 --> 00:17:41.990
I never want to see your face again!

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:58.460
<i>"I never want to see your face again."</i>

00:17:58.460 --> 00:18:00.000
<i>That isn't something you say</i>

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:02.460
<i>to someone you're meeting for the first time.</i>

00:18:02.460 --> 00:18:04.520
<i>She probably remembers everything.</i>

00:18:05.090 --> 00:18:06.740
<i>And she's definitely mad.</i>

00:18:07.250 --> 00:18:08.350
<i>Tsukiyo is also suspicious.</i>

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:10.270
<i>Two more to go!</i>

00:18:11.870 --> 00:18:13.860
H-H-Here you are.

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:14.880
Thanks.

00:18:24.820 --> 00:18:26.420
I'd like to borrow this.

00:18:26.420 --> 00:18:27.650
Yes.

00:18:27.650 --> 00:18:29.980
It's due back in two weeks.

00:18:32.330 --> 00:18:34.340
I'd like to borrow this!

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:53.520
<b>This Dating Sim Is Amazing</b>

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:49.760
<i>She appears to remember me.</i>

00:18:49.760 --> 00:18:53.110
<i>The question is whether she still loves me.</i>

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:55.450
<i>Doesn't matter...</i>

00:18:55.450 --> 00:18:57.290
<i>Library girls can always be found in one place.</i>

00:18:57.290 --> 00:18:59.060
<i>I can trigger events with her anytime.</i>

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:00.910
Hello.

00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:03.290
Aren't you Katsuragi,

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:04.790
Elsie's older brother?

00:19:05.230 --> 00:19:07.790
I've seen you pretty often during band practice.

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:11.040
I'm Yui Goido, from class A. 
Nice to meet you.

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:12.540
<i>Y-Yui?</i>

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:14.920
<i>I didn't expect her to approach me.</i>

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:18.300
<i>She started off as a shy rich girl.</i>

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:22.110
<i>But maybe our body switch, due to 
the loose soul, influenced her.</i>

00:19:23.110 --> 00:19:26.550
<i>She's turned into a confusing character, 
a girl who dresses like a boy.</i>

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:29.420
<i>Since there were lingering effects,</i>

00:19:29.420 --> 00:19:32.190
<i>I assumed she was a likely host.</i>

00:19:32.530 --> 00:19:35.600
<i>However, she's introducing herself,</i>

00:19:35.600 --> 00:19:37.870
<i>meaning she's completely forgotten me.</i>

00:19:38.390 --> 00:19:39.190
<i>In other words...</i>

00:19:39.910 --> 00:19:40.820
Goodbye.

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:43.200
<i>...Yui isn't a host.</i>

00:19:45.270 --> 00:19:46.330
Don't go.

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:50.290
I want to talk with you some more.

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:56.780
I want to know more about you.

00:19:57.570 --> 00:19:59.590
<i>Wh-What is this feeling?</i>

00:20:01.230 --> 00:20:05.020
<i>Is this an aftereffect of Yui 
conquering me when I was a girl?</i>

00:20:12.800 --> 00:20:14.810
I love you!

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:15.980
Wh-What?

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:17.240
<b>Male Partners</b>

00:20:17.470 --> 00:20:20.060
I knew from the moment I saw you

00:20:20.060 --> 00:20:22.490
that you were special.

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:24.280
B-But...

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:26.910
Haven't you heard about Kanon and me?

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:29.980
I don't care about that.

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:31.500
R-Really?

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:32.880
<i>Th-This is bad...</i>

00:20:32.880 --> 00:20:34.210
<i>I can't think—</i>

00:20:37.350 --> 00:20:39.550
What do you think you're doing?!

00:20:39.870 --> 00:20:43.230
Elsie, don't we have band practice today?

00:20:43.230 --> 00:20:43.900
Hmm?

00:20:43.900 --> 00:20:46.070
Chihiro and Ayumi didn't show up, either.

00:20:46.070 --> 00:20:48.810
The Mai High Festival is coming up, 
so you shouldn't skip practice.

00:20:49.030 --> 00:20:50.810
O-Oh...

00:20:51.510 --> 00:20:53.730
Well, I'll see you around, Katsuragi.

00:20:55.660 --> 00:20:57.940
Is that Yui Goido?

00:20:58.370 --> 00:21:00.070
P-Plea—

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:00.790
Hmm?

00:21:00.790 --> 00:21:03.400
Please be quiet in the librarian!

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:04.360
Librarian?

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:14.710
<b>Please eat this. 
For my Divine Brother. 
I'm leaving my cell phone here! 
Elsie</b>

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:16.900
She doesn't remember the conquest, 
but her love is still in effect?

00:21:16.900 --> 00:21:20.700
Since she confessed to me, she's a potential host.

00:21:20.700 --> 00:21:21.880
That sucks...

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:25.780
Then the five possible hosts are

00:21:25.780 --> 00:21:27.120
Tsukiyo Kujo,

00:21:27.120 --> 00:21:28.150
Yui Goido,

00:21:28.150 --> 00:21:29.360
Ayumi Takahara,

00:21:29.360 --> 00:21:30.520
Chihiro Kosaka,

00:21:30.520 --> 00:21:32.390
and Shiori Shiomiya.

00:21:32.710 --> 00:21:35.320
Four of them are hosting goddesses.

00:21:35.320 --> 00:21:36.300
That's right.

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:41.650
<b>Call from Chihiro</b>

00:21:39.850 --> 00:21:41.650
Ellie, did you just call me?

00:21:42.390 --> 00:21:43.610
Hello?

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:47.480
Katsuragi?

00:21:47.480 --> 00:21:49.000
Why did you answer her phone?

00:21:49.000 --> 00:21:51.270
Elsie can't come to the phone right now.

00:21:51.740 --> 00:21:53.630
So I'm passing on her messages.

00:21:55.230 --> 00:21:56.310
What is it?

00:21:57.070 --> 00:22:01.330
She said she wants to walk home with you 
tomorrow, so wait in the classroom after school.

00:22:01.330 --> 00:22:02.840
Huh? Why?

00:22:02.840 --> 00:22:04.010
No idea.

00:22:04.010 --> 00:22:05.200
That's just what she said.

00:22:05.200 --> 00:22:08.120
I don't understand, but fine... Bye-bye.

00:22:08.120 --> 00:22:08.910
Chihiro!

00:22:10.740 --> 00:22:12.860
I'm sorry about today.

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:20.930
Katsuragi, what was that phone call for?

00:22:20.930 --> 00:22:24.380
Preparation for tomorrow's 
"leaving school simultaneously" event.

00:22:24.380 --> 00:22:24.900
Huh?

00:22:25.150 --> 00:22:27.150
I'm done looking for hosts.

00:22:28.260 --> 00:22:29.910
Time for the next stage.

00:22:30.780 --> 00:22:33.190
<i>Thank you very much!</i>

00:24:05.840 --> 00:24:08.710
You're good, but you can't conquer 
five girls simultaneously.

00:24:08.710 --> 00:24:11.760
If you can't court multiple girls at 
once, you can't play dating sims.

00:24:11.760 --> 00:24:12.840
I'd like to say it's simple...

00:24:12.840 --> 00:24:14.470
But in the real world, it takes 
time to move around.

00:24:14.470 --> 00:24:15.890
Can't I revert to a save point?

00:24:15.890 --> 00:24:17.010
You're just now realizing this?

00:24:17.010 --> 00:24:18.020
Hmm? What's this notebook?

00:24:18.020 --> 00:24:20.180
Could you return that?
